---
layout: layouts/base.njk
description: "Bryant Atelier is a Byron Bay film and content studio. Brand films, documentary, short-form content and ads for businesses from Byron Bay to the Gold Coast and the Northern Rivers."
preconnectVimeo: true
homeWork: ["flowing-wood", "convivio-kalio", "bytropic-nutrition", "koud-the-breath-haus", "rogue-watches", "craved-this"]
homeReels: [1, 3]
---

{# 1. HERO ------------------------------------------------------------- #}
<section class="hero" id="top" aria-label="Introduction">
  <div class="hero__media" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="hero__poster">{% picture "work/flowing-wood.jpg", "", "100vw", [800, 1280, 1920], { eager: true } %}</div>
    <div data-hero-video="{{ site.heroVimeo }}"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="hero__scrim" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="container hero__content">
    <h1>Stories with roots. <span class="serif">Content that works.</span></h1>
    <p class="hero__sub">Brand films, documentary, content and ads. Byron Bay to the Gold Coast.</p>
    <div class="hero__actions">
      <a class="btn btn--primary" href="{{ site.ctaUrl }}">Get a free content review <span class="btn__arrow" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a>
      <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="/work/">See the work</a>
    </div>
    <p class="hero__proof"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M8 1l2 4.3 4.7.6-3.4 3.2.9 4.6L8 11.5l-4.2 2.2.9-4.6L1.3 5.9 6 5.3z"/></svg>Best Byron Bay Film, Byron Bay International Film Festival 2025</p>
  </div>
</section>

{# 2. CLIENT LOGOS ----------------------------------------------------- #}
{% include "partials/logo-strip.njk" %}

{# 3. SERVICES --------------------------------------------------------- #}
<section class="section on-light services" id="services" aria-labelledby="services-h">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head section-head--split">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">01 / Services</span>
        <h2 id="services-h" style="margin-top: 1rem">made for what lasts.</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="lede muted">From strategy and storytelling to filming and paid distribution, I run the full system so you stay focused on running your business.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="cols cols--3">
      <article class="col">
        <span class="col__num">01</span>
        <h3>Brand Films &amp; Documentary</h3>
        <p class="col__body"><span class="col__lead">Cinematic anchors.</span> Hero films, campaign work, and founder portraits for soulful premium brands. Long-form storytelling and observational work for operators with stories worth holding. Films for retreats, lodges, hotels and venues, capturing the texture of a space and the people who hold it.</p>
        <ul role="list"><li>Brand films</li><li>Founder portraits</li><li>Documentary</li><li>Place &amp; destination</li><li>Event documentary</li></ul>
        <a class="text-link" href="/work/?type=documentary">See the films <span class="btn__arrow" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a>
      </article>
      <article class="col">
        <span class="col__num">02</span>
        <h3>Monthly Content</h3>
        <p class="col__body">One shoot day a month. I turn it into a set of short-form pieces for social, all cut from the same footage. You show up every week, and it all looks like you. {% draft %}</p>
        <ul role="list"><li>One shoot day a month</li><li>Short-form for social</li><li>Reels &amp; stories</li></ul>
        <a class="text-link" href="/work/?type=content-ads">See the content <span class="btn__arrow" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a>
      </article>
      <article class="col">
        <span class="col__num">03</span>
        <h3>Ads &amp; Growth</h3>
        <p class="col__body">Every project starts with a clear plan. Great content only works if the right people see it. I run targeted paid distribution and lead capture systems that put your story in front of qualified prospects. I track what's working, refine what isn't, and continuously improve performance.</p>
        <p class="col__body" style="font-size: var(--fs-small)">I run the ads myself, from strategy and creative through to distribution and optimisation. Need your funnel and website sorted too? I work alongside growth partner <a href="https://biggsgrowth.com.au" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Biggs Growth</a>. {% draft %}</p>
        <ul role="list"><li>Strategy</li><li>Ad creative</li><li>Paid distribution</li><li>Optimisation</li></ul>
        <a class="text-link" href="/work/?type=content-ads">See the ads <span class="btn__arrow" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{# 3b. FREE OFFERS ----------------------------------------------------- #}
<section class="section on-mist" id="free" aria-labelledby="free-h">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head section-head--split">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">02 / Start free</span>
        <h2 id="free-h" style="margin-top: 1rem">start with something free. {% draft %}</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="lede muted">Two ways to get real value before you spend a dollar. Both made for your business, both within 48 hours. {% draft %}</p>
    </div>
    {% set offersLink = true %}{% include "partials/offers.njk" %}
  </div>
</section>

{# 4. SELECTED WORK ---------------------------------------------------- #}
<section class="on-dark" id="work" aria-labelledby="work-h">
  <div class="container section work-head" style="padding-bottom: var(--space-lg)">
    <div class="section-head section-head--split" style="margin-bottom: 0">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">03 / Work</span>
        <h2 id="work-h" style="margin-top: 1rem">selected films.</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="lede muted">A few recent films. Brand work and documentary, often blended.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="work-grid work-grid--3">
    {%- for p in projects | bySlugs(homeWork) %}
    {% include "partials/work-tile.njk" %}
    {%- endfor %}
  </div>
  <div class="container section" style="padding-top: var(--space-xl)">
    <div class="split-reels">
        <div class="split-reels__text">
          <span class="eyebrow">Content &amp; Ads</span>
          <h3 style="font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 3.4vw, 2.75rem); margin-top: 1rem">Visual stories that deliver results.</h3>
          <p class="muted" style="margin-top: 1rem; max-width: 30em">Short-form videos crafted to capture attention, build trust, and convert viewers into customers.</p>
          <div style="margin-top: var(--space-md); display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.75rem">
            <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="/work/">All work <span class="btn__arrow" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="split-reels__media">
          {%- for r in reels %}{% if r.n in homeReels %}{% include "partials/reel-card.njk" %}{% endif %}{% endfor %}
        </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{# 4b. WHO I WORK WITH ------------------------------------------------- #}
<section class="section on-light" id="who" aria-labelledby="who-h">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head section-head--split">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">04 / Who I work with</span>
        <h2 id="who-h" style="margin-top: 1rem">businesses with a story worth telling. {% draft %}</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="lede muted">Mostly local businesses from Byron Bay to the Gold Coast, plus outdoor and lifestyle brands further afield. {% draft %}</p>
    </div>
    {% include "partials/industries.njk" %}
  </div>
</section>

{# 5. APPROACH --------------------------------------------------------- #}
<section class="section on-mist" id="approach" aria-labelledby="approach-h">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">05 / Approach</span>
      <h2 id="approach-h">my approach.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="cols cols--3">
      <article class="col">
        <span class="col__num">01</span>
        <h3>Develop</h3>
        <p class="col__body">Story development, treatment, casting, scheduling and campaign strategy. The decisions made before a camera rolls shape everything that follows.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="col">
        <span class="col__num">02</span>
        <h3>Direct</h3>
        <p class="col__body">Direction, cinematography, sound and lighting through to editing, colour and sound design. Embedded with the work, end to end.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="col">
        <span class="col__num">03</span>
        <h3>Distribute</h3>
        <p class="col__body">Cut-downs, formats, content optimisation, community engagement and ongoing repurposing: the long tail that compounds.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
    <p class="approach__coda">One shoot. A hero film, a month of social content and the ads that carry it, all from the same footage. {% draft %}</p>
  </div>
</section>

{# 6. PROOF ------------------------------------------------------------ #}
<section class="section on-dark proof" id="recognition" aria-labelledby="proof-h">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="proof__award">
      <span class="eyebrow">06 / Recognition</span>
      <span class="badge badge--inline"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M8 1l2 4.3 4.7.6-3.4 3.2.9 4.6L8 11.5l-4.2 2.2.9-4.6L1.3 5.9 6 5.3z"/></svg>Byron Bay Film Festival winner</span>
      <h2 id="proof-h"><span class="serif">Flowing Wood</span>, Best Byron Bay Film, Byron Bay International Film Festival 2025.</h2>
    </div>
    <ul class="laurels" role="list">
      {%- for f in festivals %}
      <li><img src="/assets/laurels/{{ f.laurel }}" alt="{{ f.festival }}, {{ f.result }}" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></li>
      {%- endfor %}
    </ul>
    <ul class="proof__list" role="list">
      {%- for f in festivals %}
      <li><strong>{{ f.festival }}</strong>{% if f.place %} ({{ f.place }}){% endif %}: {{ f.result }}, {{ f.year | flags | safe }}</li>
      {%- endfor %}
    </ul>
    <p style="margin-top: var(--space-lg)"><a class="btn btn--ghost" href="/work/flowing-wood/">Watch Flowing Wood <span class="btn__arrow" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a></p>
  </div>
</section>

{# 7. TESTIMONIALS ----------------------------------------------------- #}
<section class="section on-light" id="testimonials" aria-labelledby="testimonials-h">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">07 / Testimonials</span>
      <h2 id="testimonials-h">in their words.</h2>
    </div>
    {% include "partials/testimonials.njk" %}
  </div>
</section>

{# 8. ABOUT ------------------------------------------------------------ #}
<section class="section on-mist" id="about" aria-labelledby="about-h">
  <div class="container about">
    <div class="photo-placeholder" role="img" aria-label="Photo of Joel Bryant to come">
      <span><span class="flag">[ADD PHOTO OF JOEL]</span><br><br>Portrait, 4:5, at least 1600px tall</span>
    </div>
    <div class="about__text">
      <span class="eyebrow">08 / About</span>
      <h2 id="about-h">Joel Bryant.</h2>
      <p>I'm Joel Bryant, a filmmaker and founder based in Byron Bay. {% draft %}</p>
      <p>Bryant Atelier brings my two studios under one roof: Lineage Films for brand films and documentary, and Convert Studios for content and ads. {% draft %}</p>
      <p>I direct, shoot and edit much of the work myself, from solo documentary shoots on remote coastline to campaign days with a small crew. And I run the ads. {% draft %}</p>
      <p class="muted">I come from a filmmaking background, which means I treat every piece of work as a story worth watching. That's the standard. The business outcomes follow.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{# 9. CONTACT ---------------------------------------------------------- #}
<section class="section on-deep" id="contact" aria-labelledby="contact-h">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">09 / Contact</span>
      <h2 id="contact-h">every great project starts here.</h2>
    </div>
    {% include "partials/contact-section.njk" %}
  </div>
</section>
